ze: large;\">葉月春<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_29.html\" target=\"_blank\">寫詩</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">1</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">丁&nbsp; &nbsp; 津<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/be.html\" target=\"_blank\">Bē散</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳&nbsp; &nbsp; 雷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/che-sia-mih-hoe.html\" target=\"_blank\">Che Siáⁿ-mih Hoe?</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/che-sia-mih-hoe.html\" target=\"_blank\">Che啥mih花？</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">42</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鄭惠敏<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_22.html\" target=\"_blank\">火——詹益樺</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>43</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">高嘉徽<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>詩兩首：<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2014/04/blog-post.html\" target=\"_blank\">流浪到天邊</a><br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/kap_29.html\" target=\"_blank\">孤獨kap寫作</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>44</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">李淑貞<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/e_29.html\" target=\"_blank\">離開ê滋味</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>45</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/tiau.html\" target=\"_blank\">雞tiâu</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>4</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／吳俊瑩&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／林麗津、賴昭男<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/e-kap.html\" target=\"_blank\">戰後台灣國家暴力ê展現形式：</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/e-kap.html\" target=\"_blank\">二二八kap白色恐怖概況</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">6</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">轉型正義kap不當黨產台語講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／許有為&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／張翠硯<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/ham.html\" target=\"_blank\">偷夯鼓井趁大錢</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/ham.html\" target=\"_blank\">——淺談不當黨產hām轉型正義</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">10</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">施玉鳳<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/blog-post_28.html\" target=\"_blank\">再會阿里山</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>12</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tân Tshuì-lîng<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/e128.html\" target=\"_blank\">我ê南瀛鐵馬128</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>16</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來唸七字仔</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿&nbsp; &nbsp; 墨<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/blog-post_96.html\" target=\"_blank\">拜月老</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">18</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">楊忠憲<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/blog-post_60.html\" target=\"_blank\">結婚講好話（四）</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">19</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內話</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">顏維貞<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/aitsiap.html\" target=\"_blank\">上課心得</a></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/aitsiap.html\" target=\"_blank\">——ài提升程度、tsia̍p講台語</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">20</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">謝淑鳳<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/tshui-sak.html\" target=\"_blank\">上課心得</a></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/tshui-sak.html\" target=\"_blank\">——認真學習、tshui-sak台語</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">21</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳亭蓉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/phong-phai.html\" target=\"_blank\">上課心得</a></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/phong-phai.html\" target=\"_blank\">——內容真phong-phài</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">21</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台譯se̍h-se̍h唸</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吳孟儒<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/lanbeh-phinn-oopescadores-ahpenghu.html\" target=\"_blank\">Lán佗位beh揣？<br />是Phînn-ôo、<i>Pescadores</i> a̍h是<i>Penghu</i>？</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">22</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張苡薰<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/e_3.html\" target=\"_blank\">家己ê母語家己救</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>25</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳建町<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/05/e_92.html\" target=\"_blank\"